	Replaced the four gled-create-<what> scripts and their option files with
	one script, gled-create libset|glass|stone|rnr.  'gled-create libset'
	also creates the symlink that configure needs to find the libset, and
	refuses a lib-set id already used in build_config.  'gled-create glass'
	adds the glass to glass.list with the next free class id.  'gled-create
	stone' adds the class to Stones/LinkDef.h; the base class is optional and
	--p7 includes the .h7.  'gled-create rnr' derives from the renderer of
	the base glass and marks the glass in glass.list as having its own
	renderer.

