	the .c7 include and removed ClassImp().  The old templates no longer
	compiled.  The stone template has a default constructor instead of the
	glass constructor.  The renderer template overrides only Draw(); empty
	overrides of PreDraw() and PostDraw() skipped the transformation set up
	by ZNode_GL_Rnr.  Placeholders are now written as @KEY@.

	* make/make_codegen.inc:
	Stopped defining the rule for make_dict.inc for echo_* and cleaner goals.
	configure reads the output of 'make echo_libset_id', and for a new
	libset the rule's message ended up in the libset id.

